flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Initialize NSGA2 optimizer and problem setup"]
ProblemClass["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Class attributes n_var n_obj xl xu n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Method _evaluate runs parallel evaluation using Multiprocessing Pool"]
NSGA2Node["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Configuration sampling SBX mutation PM pop_size n_gen eliminate_duplicates<br/>Calls minimize to evolve population using problem evaluations"]
PopulationNode["**Population**<br/>Individuals are vectors of 6 integer buffer capacities in {1-10}<br/>Decision variables x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5"]
Multipool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Parallel evaluation engine used by _evaluate<br/>Configured with n_cores workers"]
EvaluateFunc["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Receives one individual and n_replications<br/>Aggregates per replication KPIs then returns objectives"]
ConstraintNode["**constraint_function**<br/>Enforces structural constraints for feasibility<br/>Example rule pre press1 plus pre press2 greater or equal to 6"]
NaNHandling["**Infeasible Handling**<br/>If constraint fails return NaN objectives<br/>Such individuals are excluded from CSV export"]
RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Wrapper injects capacity vector into simulation<br/>Calls run_simulation and returns result dict"]
RunSim["**run_simulation**<br/>SimPy production model builds DelayBuffers and Machines<br/>Samples WIP and throughput and returns KPI dictionary"]
ObjectivesNode["**Objectives**<br/>Compute f1 average WIP to minimize<br/>Compute f2 negative average throughput to minimize"]
ExportCSV["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Writes feasible history rows to results CSV<br/>Skips individuals with NaN objectives"]
End["**End**<br/>Final Pareto front returned and history exported"]

Start --> ProblemClass
ProblemClass --> NSGA2Node
NSGA2Node --> PopulationNode
PopulationNode --> ProblemClass
ProblemClass --> Multipool
Multipool --> EvaluateFunc
EvaluateFunc --> ConstraintNode
ConstraintNode --> NaNHandling
ConstraintNode --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> EvaluateFunc
EvaluateFunc --> ProblemClass
ProblemClass --> ObjectivesNode
ObjectivesNode --> NSGA2Node
NSGA2Node --> ExportCSV
NaNHandling --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End